WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:09.510
Below Bókun: Stillingar (settings)
for this one session.

2
00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:15.512
Heiti (name): what the session
is called, e.g. Fyrirlestur-A.

3
00:00:15.612 --> 00:00:21.513
Nemendafjöldi (students): decides
which rooms are big enough.

4
00:00:21.613 --> 00:00:28.514
Virkt (active): untick to keep the
session but leave it out of everything.

5
00:00:28.614 --> 00:00:34.516
Tímasetja (schedule): may Besta
(the optimiser) move its time?

6
00:00:34.616 --> 00:00:39.518
Úthluta stofu (assign room):
may Besta choose its room?

7
00:00:39.618 --> 00:00:45.519
Samhliða (parallel): one of several
groups – each student attends one.

8
00:00:45.619 --> 00:00:52.729
The tutorial is Samhliða: over
the lecture, it is no clash.

9
00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:58.730
Untick Samhliða – everyone attends
it – and they clash: red ⚠ 20.

10
00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:02.733
Núllstilla (reset)
undoes it all.
